    "innovation": "By comparing top-down and bottom-up models, this paper challenges the cause of stable atmospheric methane in the 2000s, suggesting a positive trend in Amazon wetland emissions requires a re-interpretation of the large reported increase in anthropogenic emissions during that period.",
