            "paragraph": "The variational scheme (hereafter INVVAR) is described in Chevallier et al. (2005); Pison et al. (2009); it is an evolution of the analytical scheme. Briefly, INVVAR solves for weekly net emissions at grid-point resolution (2.5\u00b0 \u00d73.75\u00b0).",
