            "target_entity_type": "Source",
            "paragraph": "The analytical scheme (hereafter INVANA) is described in more details in Bousquet et al. (2005, 2011). The variational scheme (hereafter INVVAR) is described in Chevallier et al. (2005); Pison et al. (2009); it is an evolution of the analytical scheme.",
